#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40272"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "40808"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is right there.\nLet's #C000246204press on#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "41828"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's go back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42120"
msgid "Apocalypse Now!\nCome back soooooooon!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "42588"
msgid "Surely you aren't thinking of WALKING back?\nDo you intend to make me march for no purpose?\nLook for that #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "43500"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nLet's head back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "47728"
msgid "　Obtained\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Obtido:\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. popupStd_line1
msgctxt "47772"
msgid "Obtained"
msgstr "Obtido"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584296"
msgid "A wall stretches out before me."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "584668"
msgid "Checkpoint unlocked."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "584784"
msgid "Stay here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585268"
msgid "Go any further and you're dead meat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586104"
msgid "―――Listen, Master.\nWe've still got time left.\nYou're hope itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586264"
msgid "I get it…\nNow I know what #C236196003Jinako#CDEF meant by an\n\"impossible game.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586824"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF probably gave her a hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587064"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF!?\nAh―now he's ahead of us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587656"
msgid "I don't see an iota of his usual irksomeness.\nIn his expression is neither anger nor fear…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587760"
msgid "I see enlightenment and… is that, pity?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587904"
msgid "I say―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "587980"
msgid "Don't push it. DON'T."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588004"
msgid "You can't do this, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF.\nThere's no sense in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588244"
msgid "As if slipping through the entrance curtains of a\ncasual Izakaya bar, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF smoothly steps into that domain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588664"
msgid "Old man…\nI… can't stop it, at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588884"
msgid "Gahahahahahahaha!!!\nI'm no old man!\nI thought I told you, I'm a monk!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589364"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF roars laughing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589584"
msgid "I mean, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF said it himself.\n\"My Servant went away.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589668"
msgid "His Servant wasn't preyed on by #C236196003BB#CDEF's Black Noise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590216"
msgid "#C236196003Chief Gatou#CDEF……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590248"
msgid "So it… really was like that…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590696"
msgid "Old man, you too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590716"
msgid "…no. You're acting strange, old man.\nWhy would you be laughing?\nThis is bullying."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "590912"
msgid "You should be more angry, more sad, old man.\n…I mean, I really don't get it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "591344"
msgid "That's right!\nThey DID NOTHING WRONG,\nbut my papa and mama STILL DIED!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592164"
msgid "That's fine!\nJust patiently waiting for\ndeath to come, that's fine!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592232"
msgid "I won't \"escape.\"\nI don't expect anything.\nI don't want to hear the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592416"
msgid "Like a broken dam, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF pours her heart out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592632"
msgid "…and #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF has no answer to her cries."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "592880"
msgid "Only #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF, now standing on\nthe drawn precipice of death,\ngazing at #C236196003Jinako#CDEF with full composure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593044"
msgid "That's wrong. That's wrong, see.\nYour anger has utterly no meaning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "593760"
msgid "And at last, I was enlightened.\nGods exist in this world.\nYet not one god exists who saves people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594008"
msgid "Humans―――\nThey steal, kill, covet, and lastly, forget.\nOoh, yes! Truly, they are SUPER NEETS!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594240"
msgid "(Are you――)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594260"
msgid "(For real!?)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594276"
msgid "(No way!?)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "594348"
msgid "Gwaaa!\nS-so, in terms of being an animal,\nit's normal for #C236196003Jinako#CDEF to shut herself in!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595124"
msgid "Even that's starting to clearly fade away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595176"
msgid "He's being tormented by an unimaginable agony\nand an unspeakable sense of loss."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595348"
msgid "Mhm. A frightening takeaway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595808"
msgid "Or, he doesn't see himself as satisfied… perhaps."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "595936"
msgid "That's because, the gods haven't abandoned you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596068"
msgid "…then……!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596140"
msgid "Why do I have no place to go!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596180"
msgid "The #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF wails, and #C236196003Gatou#CDEF nods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596560"
msgid "Why had you nowhere to go?\nWhat reward is pain for one who lives a life\nwithout transgression?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "596664"
msgid "It's nobody's fault.\nDon't you see――you were simply in\nthe wrong place at the wrong time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597036"
msgid "And, such is your life: a fickle star."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597132"
msgid "\"…such is your life: a fickle star.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597172"
msgid "Was his conclusion so cruel and detached?\nThen how could #C236196003Gatou#CDEF say those #ROFS0003#RUBSthings#RUBEwords#REND\nwith such moving and warm affirmation?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "597448"
msgid "You――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598868"
msgid "Praetor――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598884"
msgid "Master――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598904"
msgid "Darling――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599200"
msgid "Delivered to me was #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's\nfinal #C000246204SG#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599368"
msgid "You… really did this, old man?\nSo you could say all that stuff…\nto someone like me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600224"
msgid "His strength deserves respect."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600272"
msgid "Once he accepted that he was a dead man,\nhe toiled for his allies until the very end.\n#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF stuck to what he did best."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600440"
msgid "Old man――\nDid he…\nDid he really die…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600504"
msgid "Augh…! Ah-augh――WAAAUGH!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600620"
msgid "All I meant to do was make the point\nthat EVERYONE dies in the end…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600760"
msgid "Why'd he have to go die all on his own!?\nThat's, that's――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600832"
msgid "That's not fair to me, you terrible, terrible,\nawful old man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601172"
msgid "What a piece of garbage I am.\nI can't go living with this shame!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601364"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF's words weren't able to save #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601548"
msgid "He made sure #C236196003Jinako#CDEF got the message and then some."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601616"
msgid "So it's #C236196003Jinako#CDEF who can't deal with \"still being around.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601832"
msgid "Countdown mechanism confirmed cleared.\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's status――all clear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602208"
msgid "Listen up, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\n#C000246204You're to pull back for the time being#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603288"
msgid "…#C236196003#SVT#CDEF is right.\nWe promised #C236196003Leo#CDEF and the others.\nWe have to charge forward!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "603856"
msgid "Invade Jinako's mind now."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "603884"
msgid "Prepare some more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603904"
msgid "I understand.\nVery well, then I shall wait here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604504"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF is still merely playing.\nHowever, once everyone corners her,\nshe'll bite back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604648"
msgid "Although we're the ones cornered in this place,\nI cannot imagine what a cornered #C236196003BB#CDEF will plan."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604784"
msgid "She must be captured quickly and at all costs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604944"
msgid "Very well.\nAs always, entrust everything to me――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605004"
msgid "I, #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF, with prudent care shall\ntake charge of #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605216"
msgid "I relax my worries, animosity, and pressures.\nI pour my consciousness into #C236196003Kiara#CDEF.\nMy wavering mind and body loosen, until――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605932"
msgid "Focus on your mission, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606008"
msgid "#C236196003#NICK#CDEF, you hear me?\nGreat job freeing #C236196003Jinako#CDEF."
msgstr ""

