#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638184"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638288"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638424"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638468"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638608"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638728"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "638828"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639020"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639084"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639164"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639280"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639408"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639452"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639580"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639708"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639816"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639904"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "639996"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640144"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640228"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640360"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640460"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640620"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640748"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640840"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "640972"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641072"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641280"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641404"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641536"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641628"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641752"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641832"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "641936"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642024"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "642144"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "642228"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "642308"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "642376"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "642416"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "642448"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642480"
msgid "Praetor, didn't we arrange to continue towards\nthe end of the Labyrinth? There won't be another\nopportunity if we miss this one!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642612"
msgid "Hold up, Master. It's great that you're being\ncautious, but if we're going to go for the end\nof the Labyrinth, it's now or never."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642744"
msgid "Wait. What happened to everything #C236196003Leo#CDEF said about\nreaching the end of the Labyrinth? Let's go\nwhile the chaos is still on our side!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642892"
msgid "What's wrong? Have you now become frightened\nof seeing the Labyrinth's end?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "642968"
msgid "We finally arrive at the innermost section of the 12th floor.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF is standing statue-still in the back of this room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643104"
msgid "Still no signs of #C236196003Karna#CDEF.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF has stayed all alone since the eleventh floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643216"
msgid "If her wish is for death itself,\nthen what could #C236196003Karna#CDEF possibly do about it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643312"
msgid "And I can do even less―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643344"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's dispassionate voice echoes\nthroughout the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643424"
msgid "It sounded to me like that prank she made once before.\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's tone doesn't sound serious either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643540"
msgid "Just thinking about budging a single inch makes\nall the tendons and muscles in my body squeak\nwith a voiceless wail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643660"
msgid "This is giving me goosebumps―――\nThis sensation, it's what awaits those who\nare defeated in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643796"
msgid "That's the last #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nI'll give it to you if you want it.\nYou'll just die a little."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643896"
msgid "………………*khh*……"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643920"
msgid "Praetor…\nDon't think about doing anything rash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "643972"
msgid "\"Worthy sacrifices\" is mere nonsense those who\nLIVE say. Never abandoning hope or yielding\none's will to fight is how one breaks ground."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644112"
msgid "―――Of course, that's my PUBLIC stance on\nthe matter. A manner of death such as this\nhas absolutely NO beauty to it, does it!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644244"
msgid "She means… this is as far as we go?\nBullshit.\nThis thing isn't even a trap."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644324"
msgid "Be conscious of the fact that every life in\nthe Student Council is resting on your\nshoulders. Don't fall for easy bait."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644444"
msgid "But this has been less of an impossible game\nand more of an unwinnable game of insanity.\nThere are bugs and glitches everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644576"
msgid "No need to think twice.\nWe're going to avoid this visible wall of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644652"
msgid "We can't go through it,\nbut we can't break through it either.\nDarling, let's find some other way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644752"
msgid "So this is the barrier which falls upon the\n#C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF's conquered and burns off\nthe thread of their souls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "644880"
msgid "Well? Will you go all or nothing with an\nattempt? If you're lucky… no, if your fate is\n\"nothingness,\" perhaps you'll go through?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645012"
msgid "…there's nothing to suspect. This is a trap.\nI don't think it's likely that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF\nbuilt a wall like this on her own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645148"
msgid "I'm sure that #C236196003BB#CDEF is looking down on us and\nchuckling over how frightened we are to be at death's door."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645268"
msgid "But if that's the case, then I―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645308"
msgid "If you won't #RUBS die#RUBEgo#REND, then allow me to #RUBS live#RUBEgo#REND,\n#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645420"
msgid "But… hey.\nWhat happened? You're usually so carefree.\nAre you dropping your act?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645504"
msgid "I didn't think he was here, but now it looks\nlike he overtook us. But…\nWhat's making him act like this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645612"
msgid "Oh! How very rude, coming up from behind.\nHe got ahead of us, right out of the blue. But\nhey, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF? You're acting a little strange."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645764"
msgid "And so he appears, at last.\nA protagonist has no right to show up late.\nGo and settle this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "645856"
msgid "…hm. This should be just about the right time.\n#RUBS          Monji Gatou#RUBEThis foolish monk#REND shall accept #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's\nworldly desires and self-censure―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646040"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF…?\nWhat's going on? This doesn't feel right somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646116"
msgid "In any case, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF is going for the wall of death."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "646184"
msgid "This isn't the time to be showing off."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "646224"
msgid "You'll just be throwing your life away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646264"
msgid "It is what it is.\nThis is the role I must play.\nI'm making my position clear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646344"
msgid "Gahahahahaha! If you're expecting THAT much\nfrom me, then I MUST push it! I'm truly grateful\nfor your thoughtful support!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646468"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's body snaps stiff with horror.\nI sense the machinations of the Labyrinth ruthlessly unfold."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646584"
msgid "I was unable to even react fast enough against\n#C236196003Gatou#CDEF's overly-composed determination."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646688"
msgid "No… I had a sliver of a margin to stop him.\nBut a suppressive \"determination\" swelled behind #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646808"
msgid "You'll be disassembled. All traces of you\nwill be lost from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\n―――You'll die."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "646920"
msgid "But you're as big a whale, so it'll take\nmore time to process you than other people,\nold man. Heh…. heehee…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647032"
msgid "Ahh, also, there's one more thing I forgot to\nmention. I told you I had no plan, right\n#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF? Sorry, but THAT was the lie."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647172"
msgid "Once I heard that \"someone must die,\"\nI just KNEW it was my time to shine.\nAnd that's because―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647272"
msgid "The truth is that I was already dead! Well,\nI had faintly suspected it, but once I\nregained my memories, it became clear as day!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647404"
msgid "Thus, perishing here is all the same.\nObtaining an #C000246204SG#CDEF by having a dead man die?\nWhat cleverer, GENIUS PLAN is there!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647540"
msgid "―――But this isn't something one can just laugh off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647596"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF was already dead.\nHe was probably defeated in the Near Side's #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647712"
msgid "…to tell the truth, I had a feeling that's how it was."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647768"
msgid "Before #C236196003Gatou#CDEF was attacked by #C236196003BB#CDEF,\nhe had already lost his Servant.\nSo basically, after he was defeated\nin the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, he was plunged into the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "647976"
msgid "…and so that's why."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648000"
msgid "Within the Near Side, #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF \nis a Master who's already dead."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648084"
msgid "He's a ghost who can't exist anywhere else\nbesides the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nHe's nothing more than \"a dead man's dream,\"\nhaving been processed by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF as\nbeing \"defeated\" in the Near Side――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648320"
msgid "Don't be so sad, my virtuous rivals. By my lack\nof strength, I lost the 4th Round of the #C000246204Holy\nGrail War#CDEF and cruelly returned to being dust."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648476"
msgid "However, there was an instant. Though my death\nwas decided, #C236196003BB#CDEF appeared before I ceased\nand pulled me into the Far Side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648616"
msgid "This body was a corpse all along.\nYour sorrow is misguided.\nI would prefer you think of me this way:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648720"
msgid "Though #C236196003Gatou#CDEF had died, he laughed again. He was\nuseful even after dying, and was, for a second\ntime, a great, ultra truth-seeking monk."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "648872"
msgid "You lost the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF and thought you\nwere dead, then you lived on. You were glad you\nwere saved, then you show us the truth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649020"
msgid "You said all that stuff about saving me,\nbut you've a thousand times less hope\nthan me, old man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649120"
msgid "You went on and on about gods,\nyou've always believed in them,\nand now there's no god saving you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649220"
msgid "Don't you think that's strange!?\nEverything is unfair! This world is nothing but\ncruelty, the whole thing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649328"
msgid "The normies can't be saved. Doom falls straight\ndown on losers, of course, from the day\nthey're born, like it's some big joke!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649456"
msgid "All they did was walk down the street.\nAnd they get flattened, like it's some movie?\nThat's not funny!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649560"
msgid "An accident with a truck, what?\nIt slipped on an icy road, what?\nThey \"weren't lucky,\" WHAT?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649656"
msgid "Does that mean people without talent\ndon't even have LUCK!?\nThey don't even get the chance to COMPLAIN!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649764"
msgid "I'm done. I'm done with this now.\nI can't take this awful game of neglect!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649840"
msgid "The gods abandoned papa and mama.\nThey even abandoned me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "649900"
msgid "So what can I do, even if I'm alive? There's no\nsalvation anywhere in this kind of world.\nThe only fair place is on the internet!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650032"
msgid "So there's nothing I can do about it, right?\nI did nothing wrong. Of course I'll\nconfine myself to the internet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650148"
msgid "No, the internet is only fair when it comes to\nwasting time. We all keep a friendly distance.\nSort of feeling like friends is good enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650288"
msgid "We envy together, hate together,\nsplit our goods together, laugh together,\nshare in the futility of it all!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650396"
msgid "I mean, they never existed to begin with.\nThose gods who watch over everyone\nnever existed anywhere!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650500"
msgid "These cries didn't come from being\ntrapped in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF―\nThey were pent up inside her since long before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650640"
msgid "I can't even recall my memories from before the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF.\nI'm probably not qualified to sympathize with\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF's grief."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650800"
msgid "If anyone can dispel her darkness,\nit's one person and one person only."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650872"
msgid "……now this is a bit of a pickle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650908"
msgid "Listen, #C236196003Carigiri#CDEF.\nYou said that there are no such things\nas gods, but you're mistaken."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651012"
msgid "Gods exist. They positively do.\nI traversed the world and came into\ncontact with many, far too many gods."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651120"
msgid "There were indigenous gods. There were invader\ngods. Gods born from natural intercourse.\nGods born from commercialization."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651244"
msgid "There were fearsome curse gods.\nSensual goddesses that interested me greatly.\nEven moe gods that I didn't quite understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651368"
msgid "Truly an infinite variety, and not all\nconcepts of gods lie solely in Japan.\nIt's a global phenomenon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651472"
msgid "Although I was overwhelmed by the diversity,\nI came upon a truth.\nAll gods have something in common."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651576"
msgid "I bet I hardly need to tell YOU.\nOut in the real world, on this planet there\nexist no gods who bless individuals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651692"
msgid "And do you know why that is?\n――――it's simple.\nHumans are sculpted #RUBS         as avatars #RUBEin the gods' images#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651820"
msgid "Humans were just wretched NEETS all along!\nThere's nothing wrong with that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651896"
msgid "(A serious dumbf-monk has appeared!!!)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651936"
msgid "(So the truth has been revealed!?)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651972"
msgid "That's right. Because――if all of one's basic\nneeds are met, it is only natural to shut in.\nAt their core, humans are idle, sinful beings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652112"
msgid "Humans cannot deny their born wickedness.\nThus, they cannot help but to punish themselves!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652204"
msgid "Foolish or no, people failed to punish\n\"humanity.\" Birds of a feather after all.\nAnd for us birds, a need for gods arose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652328"
msgid "The gods don't save people. The gods,\npersonified by humanity's ideals, treat people\nas evil――as was our true desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652448"
msgid "This is what gods are: humanity's ultimate\npunishment. From having ran about the Earth and\nstudied all religions, that is my takeaway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652584"
msgid "Punishment?\nThis is God's… punishment?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652624"
msgid "The parts of #C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF's soul\nwhich compose him――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652696"
msgid "At best, I'd expect these physical… visual\ncomponents to occupy no more than one\nsmall portion of his resources."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652812"
msgid "Despite that, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF explains merit with\nevermore fluidity and increasing volume."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652912"
msgid "I gave myself to rage and sought a perfect god.\nI kept searching for a primordial god,\nunbesmirched by the wickedness of man."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653040"
msgid "…I did that, knowing that the very\naction itself was evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653100"
msgid "…hm. Well, that's enough of that.\nI was enthusiastic in my youth.\nYou don't need to hear about half of my life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653216"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF suddenly took a breath\nand looked at the palm of his hand.\nHis fingertips were riddled with holes now.\nOverflowing with Noise, one couldn't even tell\nif he was holding up scissors or paper."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653428"
msgid "#C236196003Carigiri#CDEF.\nLamenting me or the gods is a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653500"
msgid "The gods never watched over anyone to\nbegin with. From the very beginning,\nno one had ever abandoned you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653608"
msgid "Then why am I the only one\nwho suffers this much!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653660"
msgid "My left arm is reacting.\nIt's the signal that an #C000246204SG#CDEF is materializing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653748"
msgid "Except…\n#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF's arm was shining too,\nand with a far greater intensity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653844"
msgid "#C236196003Gatou#CDEF wasn't bestowed with the #C000246204Five Meditations#CDEF technique,\nbut in his arm burns a radiance that shouldn't be,\nand it shines dazzlingly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654012"
msgid "Hold on, what does that mean?\n…the wrong place… at the wrong time?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654084"
msgid "Sure.\nThe life you led for yourself,\nthe environment you exposed yourself to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654164"
msgid "…that modest dream for a future where you came\nto know contentment.\nIt was a future you never got your hands on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654280"
msgid "Every one of those things in your life\nwas little more than a fickle star\nthat refused to align."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654380"
msgid "His voice was humble yet bold.\nThus spoke #C236196003Gatou#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654448"
msgid "To call someone's life \"a fickle star\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654492"
msgid "It's as if he were a teacher slapping some\nglittery stickers on a few homework assignments\nafter their pupils slaved away to finish them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654632"
msgid "You can't just chalk everything I've been\nthrough up to bad timing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654700"
msgid "My circumstances were unhappy coincidences?\nAre you joking?! That doesn't work――bad RNG is\na game thing. People can't live that way!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654836"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF screams again.\nYou can see her heart cave in on itself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654916"
msgid "What's cruel and certain is that the more\n#C236196003Jinako#CDEF senses #C236196003Gatou#CDEF's nearing death,\nthe brighter the #C000246204SG#CDEF shines."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655072"
msgid "This corrupted monk's coercive lecture imparts\nonto #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind the absolute truth about the\nmeaning and futility of death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655216"
msgid "Though likely blinded by now, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF turns his\neyes towards his arm and smiles, satisfied.\nOr so it looked like to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655352"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF, indeed, you are to blame.\nYour surroundings are also to blame. All facets\nof life are in themselves our transgressions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655496"
msgid "That's what life is.\nEverything is at fault.\nIs it not foolish to lament this?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655576"
msgid "You're the foolish one, old man!\nYou're a big fat liar,\nway more than someone like me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655664"
msgid "You've been all alone this whole time,\neven more than me, haven't you?\nNo one understood you, did they!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655772"
msgid "Indeed. Sad, but sad is all it was. Even then,\nby looking elsewhere there's joy to be found.\nLife is conflict between meaning and futility."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655912"
msgid "Look at it this way, young one! Your timing\ncould have been better――that's all.\nEverything in your life could be better!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656036"
msgid "If you don't believe me, just say it out loud!\nFeel the weight fall off your shoulders!\nGahahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656140"
msgid "While laughing, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF abruptly spins around.\nHis face is hardly recognizable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656236"
msgid "His frail, Noise-coated hand reaches towards me.\nAs if beckoning me――\nAs if trying to grab at me――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656340"
msgid "Go ahead. Meet with the fool,\nfor his hand has touched Enlightenment――\nthe greatest gift life has to offer!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656452"
msgid "A chill jolts through me. This is farewell.\nThe moment I clutched his hand,\nit spontaneously disintegrated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656560"
msgid "For the slightest instant――\nHe firmly grips back, enough to hurt.\nHis grip felt like a gnarled, sun-baked rock."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656676"
msgid "Of course.\nI know little about these #C000246204SG#CDEF things,\nbut I did this on my own accord."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656776"
msgid "So, it is time that I expire, for a man who\nspends his lifetime seeking Nirvana\nhas no business wavering before Death."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656896"
msgid "If my end takes the shape of a helping hand,\nthen let me pluck #C236196003Jinako Carigiri#CDEF's thorn!\nDeath doesn't get any better than that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657040"
msgid "That said, even if I can heal your mind,\na woman's waist size is outside of my\nhumble jurisdiction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657140"
msgid "Farewell, #C236196003Jinako#CDEF! Until we meet again,\nbe diligent with your dieeet! The average\nweight for an adult woman is 65 kilograaams!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657284"
msgid "Grr, there's a reason no one asked you!\nAll systems are green here, thank you very much!\nNow, shoo! Shoo!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657392"
msgid "Pfft-haha! Bravado #RUBS      sustains no one#RUBEis the spice of life#REND, I see!\nStill, you're not going to make things better\nfor yourself with white lies alone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657560"
msgid "#C236196003Monji Gatou#CDEF disintegrates――laughing until the very end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657636"
msgid "He may have accepted that this would\nhappen ever since he got his memories back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657720"
msgid "This isn't, this isn't happening!\nI didn't mean for this!\nI didn't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657788"
msgid "I didn't want to kill――\nas if I would actually mean all that\n\"go ahead and die\" stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657880"
msgid "Why did you up and die, huh?\nTo show off? To impress me?\nTo put my foot in my mouth?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657968"
msgid "None of that was worth your life!\nWhat's wrong with you!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658028"
msgid "You sacrifice yourself, tell me to live on\nand whatever――it's a disgrace!\nNow I REALLY have nobody to turn to!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658144"
msgid "Enough. I've had enough!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658172"
msgid "Don't follow me. Don't anyone come near me!\nSomeone like me should be locked up\nand left alone FOREVER!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658276"
msgid "No, that may be wrong.\nIf anything, #C236196003Gatou#CDEF probably saved #C236196003Jinako#CDEF \"too well.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658384"
msgid "The answer #C236196003Gatou#CDEF showed her was so correct that #C236196003Jinako#CDEF,\nwho hates her own weakness so much, couldn't take it anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658536"
msgid "With the loss of the #C000246204SG#CDEF,\nthe Labyrinth's twelfth floor is now\ntemporarily stabilized."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658640"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF. Your #RUBS         System Voice#RUBEemotionless reporting#REND is more\ndevoid of appreciation than ever. It's a good\nresponse to gain us back our composure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658820"
msgid "No, I'm sure you hate that your computer talk\nis all you can use to help out at this point."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658912"
msgid "The battle within #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's mind is nigh.\nAlong with you, we…\nwe all need a little time to clear our heads."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "659036"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "659064"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659092"
msgid "#C236196003Jinako#CDEF remains asleep, even when turned into a relief…\nComparing her expression to all the other #C000246204Sentinels#CDEF\nup until now, hers is somewhat lonely."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "659272"
msgid "Return to the old school?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659300"
msgid "This is where #C236196003Jinako#CDEF ran off to, isn't it?\nUnlike #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF,\nher foundations are less firm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659444"
msgid "Unlike a newly born, innocent #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF,\nthis relief's pattern is filled with weakness\nand contradictions unique to humans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659584"
msgid "―――Ah, I mustn't! I mustn't!\nWhile it begs my curiosity,\nI must end my idle talks here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659676"
msgid "Releasing #C236196003Jinako#CDEF is important,\nbut countering #C236196003BB#CDEF remains a priority."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659780"
msgid "We may begin the infiltration right away.\nAre your preparations in order, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?\nLet me know when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659912"
msgid "I've been waiting for you.\nShall we begin intruding on #C236196003Jinako#CDEF's Relief?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660000"
msgid "I take a long, deep breath and loosen my body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660048"
msgid "I'll be fine.\nI've been through this three times already."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660108"
msgid "Thank goodness.\nIt appears that once again, you safely\nunraveled the heart of a maiden."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660196"
msgid "I'll take care of #C236196003Jinako#CDEF until she wakes up.\nI will move her to the old school building\nat once and tend to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660328"
msgid "Cross over to the Near Side like we planned.\nGo down those stairs and head to the\nend of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660432"
msgid "We see no anomalies in the Labyrinth at present.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF appears unable to meet our advance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660536"
msgid "As an AI, she lacks combat functionality.\nShe's no threat to you,\nwho defeated #RUBS us both #RUBE#C236196003Lancer#CDEF#REND and #C236196003Karna#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660692"
msgid "That's right.\nThis is the one and only decisive match.\nNone of us can afford to slip up now!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660788"
msgid "Until you get back to the Near Side, this is it.\nLet's roll up our sleeves and get this done!"
msgstr ""

